        "text": "The reference class is same-variant BLS JOLTS Table 4 Total quits rate, seasonally adjusted, first print. Base rate anchor: the seven fetched first prints since January 2026 are 2.0, 1.9, 2.0, 1.9, 1.9, 2.0, and 1.9 percent, giving a mean of 1.943 percent and a median of 1.9 percent."
